function transfer(direction){const side=direction==='upload'?'local':'remote',files=side==='local'?localFiles:remoteFiles,items=[...selected[side]].map(i=>files[i]);window.transferDraft={ownerName:names[protocol],ownerAddress:host,direction,items:items.map(f=>[...f]),sourcePath:ftpPaths[side],targetPath:ftpPaths[side==='local'?'remote':'local'],destination:side==='local'?remoteFiles:localFiles};modal(direction==='upload'?'上传确认':'下载确认',`<p>${esc(ftpPaths[side])} → ${esc(ftpPaths[side==='local'?'remote':'local'])} · ${items.length} 项</p><div class="global-log">${items.map(f=>esc(f[0])).join('<br>')}</div><label class="check" style="margin-top:14px"><input id="simulate-conflict" type="checkbox">演示同名文件冲突</label>`,`<button class="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><div class="grow"></div><button class="button primary" id="start-transfer">开始传输</button>`)}
function finishTransfer(idx){const job=tasks[idx];if(!job||job.status!=='传输中')return;if(!job.applied){for(const item of job.data.items){const dest=job.data.destination,existing=dest.findIndex(f=>f[0]===item[0]);if(existing>=0&&job.mode==='跳过')continue;if(existing>=0&&job.mode==='覆盖'){dest[existing]=[...item];continue}const copy=[...item];if(existing>=0)copy[0]+=' (副本)';dest.push(copy)}job.applied=true}job.status='已完成';notify('传输完成。');if(protocol==='ftp')renderFtp();if(document.querySelector('.transfer-manager'))showTasks()}
